{"id":"HKF-058","kind":"technical","key":"t2_decisions_objective_solver","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"Minimizes weighted energy and latency (Eqs. 14–15) over DNN partition point, UAV trajectory, compute ratio, GU transmit power, and offloading via Alternating Optimization: OPPS (Alg. 1), fairness-based UAV-GU matching (Alg. 2), and TD3 (DPDTS); Table I (p. 8) is populated and legible.","evidence":[{"page":4,"section":"III / Eq. (15)","quote":"We aim to minimize the system's weighted latency and energy consumption, by jointly optimizing the DNN optimal partition point"},{"page":5,"section":"IV. Algorithm Design","quote":"Due to the non-convexity of (15), we adopt an Alternating Optimization framework and decompose it into three subproblems."},{"page":6,"section":"IV.C Trajectory and Transmit Power Optimization Algorithm","quote":"DPDTS adopts a training mechanism for the twin delayed deep deterministic policy gradient (TD3) [39] with offline replay buffers and delayed updates"},{"page":8,"section":"V / TABLE I","quote":"T: 900 s; Delta: 0.6 s; eta: 0.5; g0: 1.42x10^-4; sigma^2: -100 dBm; kappa: 10^-28; fi: 1 GHz; fj: 15 GHz; lambda_i: [0, 5]; ti: [0, 2]; num: 3x10^6; N: 1500; gamma: 0.99; Lb: 256; L: 10^5; d: 3; lra/lrc: 3x10^-4"}],"note":"HKF-058-selected-pages.pdf (orig pp. 4, 5, 6, 8). Visually confirms populated Table I on p. 8."}
